- First-run gate (nemesis.onboarding.v1) routes cold starts to /welcome (student build)
- Steps: welcome -> connect accounts (reuses Connections) -> mission cards
  ('Read my semester' / 'Find my study materials' prefill agent sessions) +
  Imports drop fallback -> Today
- Companion agent skill: nemesis-import (local discovery, Anki collection read,
  Quizlet fetch, Notion/Docs conversion) lives in ~/.hermes/skills
